7. Middleware

The LLD defines the responsibilities of middleware.

Middleware

	

Purpose




authMiddleware

	

Verifies JWT




roleMiddleware

	

Checks student/teacher permissions




Validation

	

Checks request data

Example

A student tries to mark attendance.

Request reaches the backend.

JWT is verified.

Role is checked.

Student is denied because only teachers can mark attendance.

The backend should return 403 Forbidden for an authenticated user without the required permission.

